    "title": "",
    "legend": "A multilobulated mass of the anterior tongue. Spindle to stellate cells with a vague fascicular to whorled architecture. The nuclei are ovoid and monomorphic, with scattered atypia; mitotic activity is not conspicuous. There is variable myxohyaline stroma. RNA sequencing confirmed the presence of an <em>RREB1</em>::<em>MRTFB</em> gene fusion.",
